  "question": {
    "text": "The difference between degree and order of a differential equation that represents the family of curves given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is _______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Put in equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Squaring both the sides we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Degree <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Degree <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo></math> order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
